description=System tweaks: I/O scheduler, component disable, appops, game mode. Run-on-demand, no persistent daemon. Includes a fingerprint-locked Zygisk fix for a SystemUI MediaMetadata NPE crash (Infinix X6815B, firmware 231020V486 only — inert no-op elsewhere). v1.2: merged the SystemUI MediaMetadata NPE Zygisk fix into this module.
